    turnFlow: 'Correlativa follows a train-style domino layout from a central opening double. Players extend legal train ends by matching pips. If a player cannot play, they draw one tile from the boneyard and continue drawing until they can play or the boneyard is exhausted. The deal ends when a player empties their hand or all players are blocked with no draw available.',
